            <div xml:id="d229">

                <pb facs="0224" n="212" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg212"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.00/1938: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in the United
                        Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-12-10T21:00:00-04:00">December 10,
                            1942—9 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>6255. Department’s 5604, November 7 and 5924, November 24. Tehran reports British
                    Army arrested and interned at Sultanabad on December 8 General Zahidi,
                    Governor-General of Isfahan. Both Shah and Prime Minister reported greatly upset
                    and taking line that action was unfair because Iranian Government was not
                    consulted and arbitrary because British had no right to make arrest. Shah has
                    sent personal representative to register protest with our Minister.</p>
                <p>Dreyfus states arrest has aggravated already critical situation which is
                    evidenced by widespread and serious rioting in Tehran.</p>
                <p>Please express to Foreign Office our concern over this development. We are
                    particularly surprised that such apparently drastic action should have been
                    taken in the light of the Foreign Office attitude reported in your 6651,
                    November 25, from which we had understood that British Government shared our
                    views regarding the advisability of proceeding cautiously and of taking no
                    action without the concurrence of the Iranian authorities.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
